The release 3.24 branch has not yet been created.  Please continue to update the devel branch.
The core team will automatically create the RELEASE_3_24 branch on git.bioconductor.org but until that time the only branch accessible is devel.  Do NOT try to create a RELEASE_3_24 branch on your own; the core team will do this for you next week Monday.  Bioconductor will also handle bumping the y of a package version x.y.z  on release day.

